From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muse <muse@local>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 23:20:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: always add "close subtitle" entry to subtitle combo

Right-click menu "close subtitle" works by
`_set_primary_subtitle_from_menu("off")` ->
`subtitle_combo.setCurrentIndex(1)` -> `currentIndexChanged` ->
`_change_subtitle_selection` -> `apply_subtitle_mode("off")`.

But `_populate_subtitle_combo` only added the "close subtitle"
(index 1) entry when there were unified subtitle options. When a
video had no detected subtitle tracks (empty `_subtitle_tracks`),
the combo only had index 0 ("auto"), so `setCurrentIndex(1)` was a
no-op and the right-click menu could not turn off subtitles.

Always add the "close subtitle" entry so index 1 always exists.
When options exist the combo layout is unchanged
([auto, off, track...]); when none exist it becomes [auto, off],
and `setCurrentIndex(1)` still emits `currentIndexChanged` even
if the combo is disabled (programmatic change).
---
 src/atv_player/ui/player_window.py | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/atv_player/ui/player_window.py b/src/atv_player/ui/player_window.py
--- a/src/atv_player/ui/player_window.py
+++ b/src/atv_player/ui/player_window.py
@@ -8602,8 +8602,11 @@ class PlayerWindow(ThemedWidgetWindowBase, AsyncGuardMixin):
         self.subtitle_combo.blockSignals(True)
         self.subtitle_combo.clear()
         self.subtitle_combo.addItem("字幕", ("auto", None))
+        # “关闭字幕”必须始终存在：右键菜单的“关闭字幕”靠
+        # subtitle_combo.setCurrentIndex(1) 触发，若无字幕轨道时不加，
+        # setCurrentIndex(1) 是空操作，右键关不了字幕。
+        self.subtitle_combo.addItem("关闭字幕", ("off", None))
         if self._unified_primary_subtitle_options:
-            self.subtitle_combo.addItem("关闭字幕", ("off", None))
             for option in self._unified_primary_subtitle_options:
                 self.subtitle_combo.addItem(
                     option.label,
